From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:55:22 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Admin enrolls and removes participants from event show

Add Admin\EnrollmentsController create/destroy under
/admin/events/{event_id}/enrollments, validate enrollments in
Enrollment::validates() (user exists and is a participant, event exists
and has spots, no duplicates) and list enrollments with a remove button
and a participant select on the admin event show page.
